---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Five CPU samples of the Todo service (illustrative counts) and how flat and cum are counted from them.
const W = 900;
const H = 256;
const cols = [
  ['conn.serve', 'listTodos', 'writeJSON', 'Encode'],
  ['conn.serve', 'listTodos', 'writeJSON', 'Encode'],
  ['conn.serve', 'listTodos', 'writeJSON', 'write'],
  ['conn.serve', 'getTodo'],
  ['conn.serve', 'listTodos', 'store.list'],
];
const rows = [
  ['conn.serve', 0, 5],
  ['listTodos', 0, 4],
  ['writeJSON', 0, 3],
  ['Encode', 2, 2],
  ['write', 1, 1],
  ['store.list', 1, 1],
  ['getTodo', 1, 1],
];
---
<figure class="gp18a">
  <div class="gp18a-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Five stack samples taken while the Todo service handles requests. Each sample is a column of function names with the running function on top. A table counts, for each function, how many samples had it on top (flat) and how many had it anywhere in the stack (cum).">
    <DiagramIcon name="measure" x={32} y={19} size={26} />
    <text x="50" y="24" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Five samples, one call stack each</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Năm mẫu, mỗi mẫu một call stack</tspan>
    </text>
    <DiagramIcon name="chart" x={612} y={19} size={26} />
    <text x="632" y="24" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Counting them</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Đếm lại</tspan>
    </text>

    {cols.map((col, i) => (
      <g>
        {col.map((name, l) => (
          <g>
            <rect x={20 + i * 112} y={188 - l * 36} width="104" height="30" rx="5" class={l === col.length - 1 ? 'leaf fm-glow' : 'box'} />
            <text x={72 + i * 112} y={208 - l * 36} text-anchor="middle" class="body">{name}</text>
          </g>
        ))}
        <text x={72 + i * 112} y="236" text-anchor="middle" class="m">
          <tspan data-lang-en>sample {i + 1}</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>mẫu {i + 1}</tspan>
        </text>
      </g>
    ))}

    <line x1="580" x2="580" y1="40" y2="240" class="rule" />

    <text x="600" y="62" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>function</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>hàm</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="790" y="62" text-anchor="end" class="b">flat</text>
    <text x="870" y="62" text-anchor="end" class="b">cum</text>
    <line x1="600" x2="870" y1="72" y2="72" class="rule" />
    {rows.map((r, i) => (
      <g>
        <text x="600" y={96 + i * 22} class="body">{r[0]}</text>
        <text x="790" y={96 + i * 22} text-anchor="end" class="body num">{r[1]}</text>
        <text x="870" y={96 + i * 22} text-anchor="end" class="body num">{r[2]}</text>
      </g>
    ))}
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Illustrative counts, not a real capture. The function on top of a stack (gold) is the one running at that instant, so it earns one flat sample. Every function anywhere in the stack earns one cum sample, which is why conn.serve has 0 flat and 5 cum.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Số liệu minh họa, không phải capture thật. Hàm nằm trên cùng của stack (màu vàng) là hàm đang chạy lúc đó nên được tính một mẫu flat. Mọi hàm có mặt trong stack đều được tính một mẫu cum, vì vậy conn.serve có flat 0 nhưng cum 5.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp18a { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp18a-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp18a svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp18a text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp18a .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp18a .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp18a .body { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp18a .m { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp18a .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp18a .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp18a .leaf { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .gp18a .rule { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp18a figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
